 "info": {
  "good_to_know": [
   "The Book of Life is at the back of the Church from 24 October to 30 November for writing the names of departed loved ones; it is brought forward at Masses in November.",
   "Gubbio, the parish cafe, is open on Sundays 11, 18 and 25 October from 8am to 1pm for coffee and snacks."
  ]
 },
